{"3294750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MUBOSAMA", "steam_appid": 3294750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;MUBOSAMA&quot; is an adventure game based on urban legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294750/extras/2e7634a3ad7692628653820208342417.avif?t=1761521569\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a humid day, we were spending our usual summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catching beetles, chasing dogs, finding good spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, we learned about her existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faceless deity... MUBOSAMA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this time... she had been close to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294750/extras/06d0a369f847a48f56aa15e9e9e65cc0.avif?t=1761521569\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A walking simulator where various events occur as you walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Progress the story by investigating objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    No quest markers or time limits, allowing for a relaxed playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    She wants to play with everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings: 6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 30–60 minutes </p><